  m_text: "As the moon reaches its zenith, a delicate, esoteric melody wanders adrift
    through the night air. The Dreamweaver, a mythical entity known only in ancient
    legends, has arrived. \n\nAlthough everything seems quiet I can't really put
    my head above, what is thy wish of the truthfully eternal wisdom"
